{"id":"b1d7d34b5fcabe9e","group":"92","path":"92/92-fact-consistency-true.md","title":"fact-consistency-true — Consistency Statement is True","display":"fact-consistency-true — Consistency Statement is True","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-fact-consistency-true","aliases":["92-fact-consistency-true"],"display":"fact-consistency-true — Consistency Statement is True","depends_on":["[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-standard-model]]","[[92-df-provability-predicate]]"],"source":"第 IX 章 p. 108（PDF 125）","source_status":"原书一致性语义的本地实例"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-fact-consistency-true"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-fact-consistency-true</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-consistency-true — Consistency Statement is True"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"68f172d58c15e75d\" href=\"?note=68f172d58c15e75d\" title=\"92-df-consistency-statement\">92-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ccb738ae4bbf923c\" href=\"?note=ccb738ae4bbf923c\" title=\"92-df-standard-model\">92-df-standard-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IX 章 p. 108（PDF 125）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书一致性语义的本地实例"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span> (internal consistency sentence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"68f172d58c15e75d\" href=\"?note=68f172d58c15e75d\" title=\"92-df-consistency-statement\">92-df-consistency-statement</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (external consistency predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_G\">\\(\\mathfrak N_G\\)</span> (standard model, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ccb738ae4bbf923c\" href=\"?note=ccb738ae4bbf923c\" title=\"92-df-standard-model\">92-df-standard-model</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}true}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\mathrm{Con}_G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}true}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\mathrm{Con}_G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span>：内部一致性句在标准模型中真</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>外部相容，则不存在编码为自然数的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>矛盾证明</li>\n<li>因而标准证明谓词不会见证<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\\)</span></li>\n<li>该蕴涵使用内部证明公式在标准模型中正确表示外部<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\)</span>；若任意更换成不正确的公式，仅有外部相容性不足以推出右端</li>\n<li>这是第二不完备性定理的背景：\n<ul>\n<li>在第二不完备性定理的额外假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span>不可由<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>证明</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>标准模型正确的证明公式把外部没有矛盾证明译为内部一致性句真值；HBL 条件本身不提供这种正确性，二者在所选参数中分别声明。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 IX 章 p. 108（PDF 125）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"68f172d58c15e75d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-standard-model","status":"resolved","id":"ccb738ae4bbf923c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-standard-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"68f172d58c15e75d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}_G$ (internal consistency sentence, see [[92-df-consistency-statement]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}(G)$ (external consistency predicate, see [[92-df-consistent]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-standard-model","status":"resolved","id":"ccb738ae4bbf923c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak N_G$ (standard model, see [[92-df-standard-model]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak N_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}true}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\mathrm{Con}_G","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\mathrm{Con}_G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prf}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1701,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-364","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-fact-consistency-true]]"}],"outgoing":["68f172d58c15e75d","c7befd96bd551ade","ccb738ae4bbf923c","e9cc91aaee998c7b"]}